Thus begins the tale of hero:
Let the chimes, a whole number, become zero.
Do this 15 times:
Let the chimes now be the sum of one and the chimes.
If the remainder of the chimes and 15 is zero, then:
Proclaim "FizzBuzz, amen".
Otherwise:
If the remainder of the chimes and 3 is zero, then:
Proclaim "Fizz again".
Otherwise:
If the remainder of the chimes and 5 is zero, then:
Proclaim "Buzz, say when".
Otherwise:
Proclaim the text of the chimes.
So be it.
So be it.
So be it.
So be it.
Proclaim "Sing it, in rhymes".
